{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To journey through fair Japan, let our plans begin,\nIn the city of Kyoto, the capital of the past,\nWhere ancient shrines and temples stand,\nWith their beauty and grace, they'll capture your heart,\n\nThe first day, let us walk through Kyoto's streets,\nTo the Kiyomizu-dera, a temple of wood and stone,\nWhere the waters flow and the spirits reside,\nNext, the Fushimi Inari-taisha, with its rows of red gates,\nIn the twilight, let us wander through its paths,\n\nThe second day, to Nara, a city of deer and peace,\nWhere the Tōdai-ji stands, with its grand Buddha,\nLet us visit the Kasuga Taisha, with its lanterns lit,\nIn the evening, let us stroll through Naramachi's old streets,\n\nThe third day, to Mount Fuji, a symbol of Japan,\nLet us gaze upon its snow-capped peak,\nFrom the Fifth Station, let us walk its trails,\nThen, to Hakone, for a traditional onsen bath,\nTo soothe our weary bones and spirits,\n\nThe fourth day, to Tokyo, the city of neon lights,\nLet us explore the Senso-ji, with its vibrant energy,\nThen, to the Shibuya Crossing, the heart of modern Tokyo,\nIn the evening, let us dine at a sushi bar,\nTo taste the finest of Japan's culinary arts,\n\nThe fifth day, to Kamakura, the city of the Buddha,\nLet us visit the Great Buddha, a symbol of tranquility,\nThen, to the Hase-dera, with its wooden statue of Kannon,\nIn the afternoon, let us relax on the beach of Yuigahama,\n\nThus, our journey through Japan will end,\nWith memories of beauty and grace,\nIn the land of the rising sun, we'll find our peace,\nAnd return to our homes, with hearts full of joy.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.329420566558838}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -2.6457812786102295}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.791904091835022}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -3.5474436283111572}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.007816087454557419}, {